    basic: 'Use the ascending order to your advantage. If an opponent reveals a 10 at Position 4 (out of 6), you know that Positions 1-3 MUST be lower than 10, and Positions 5-6 MUST be higher than 10.',
    intermediate: "The Partner Signal: When your partner shows you a card, they are often showing you a 'boundary' card (like a 6 or 7). Use this to deduce their other cards and narrow down the possibilities for the opponents.",
